Because each episode of 'Don't Hug Me, I'm Scared,' features a bit of a dark turn towards the end.

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:06.260
Like arts and crafts with a real heart!

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:08.880
Or a giant can eating a duck alive!

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:11.760
Oh, yeah! You're in THAT part of YouTube again!

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:13.020
But, even though 'Don't Hug Me, I'm Scared'

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:18.560
is genuinely one of the weirdest
things I've watched on YouTube, I really like it!

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:23.200
It's really, REALLY well done and
you should absolutely watch it!

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.500
At its core, this series is all about YouTube.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:28.780
'Don't Hug Me, I'm Scared' s creators, Becky Sloan and Joseph Pelling

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:31.460
pretty much started this from scratch on the site.

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:35.429
The first episode came out only three
