00:01:35.429 --> 00:01:36.989
episode of Game Theory.

00:01:36.989 --> 00:01:41.020
It's a long time ago, so I feel like we have a kindred history, here.

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:44.000
But also, I like it because this show
